{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"D-概形"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"D-概形"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $X$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal D_X$ 为其上的"},{"Local":{"url":"微分层","text":"微分算子层"}},{"Plain":". $\\mathcal D_X$-代数是指. 仿射 $\\mathcal D_X$-概形是 $\\mathcal D_X$-代数的对偶.</p>\n"}]}}